# AI STAR CUBE agent registry — single source of truth for BOTH layers
# (wezterm/agents.lua and the zsh Init panel read this same file)
#
# Columns (TAB separated):
#   id      machine id, unique
#   label   display label (shown in 2 AGENT)
#   exe     executable NAME (resolved via PATH + absolute candidates)
#           or an ABSOLUTE PATH
#   mode    flag  = agent receives <cwd_flag> <project-root>
#           cwd   = spawn cwd carries identity (no flag)
#   flag    cwd flag for flag-mode agents (e.g. -C, --cwd)
#   clear   1 = clear screen after splash (line-based REPLs)
#
# Equal footing: a row whose exe cannot be resolved is HIDDEN, never an error.
# Register new agent types by appending rows; restart the panel or press r.
codex	OpenAI Codex CLI	codex	flag	-C	0
grok	Grok Build CLI	grok	flag	--cwd	0
kimi	Kimi Code CLI	kimi	cwd		0
deepseek	DeepSeek CLI	deepseek	cwd		1
